# Test Case 2: High Register Pressure Loop
# Demonstrates loop-depth weighted spill costs and long live ranges.
# Variables inside loop bodies have 10x higher spill penalty.

sum = 0
i = 0
limit = 100
step = 1
factor = 5
L_LOOP:
temp = i * factor
sum = sum + temp
i = i + step
cond = i < limit
if cond goto L_LOOP
return sum
